| makeresults
``` DRAPE Index v1.1. Use this code in a macro or simply call it inline inside a search query or dashboard ```

| eval TP=60, FP=30, IC=10  ``` input example. IC (inconclusive alerts) is optional: use 0 for the v1.0 score ```

``` Define the weights (FP penalty, TP precision reward, inconclusive alert cost as a share of one FP) ```
| eval k=0.20, w=0.38, a=0.5

``` Inconclusive alerts count as a fraction of a false positive ```
| eval EFP=FP+(a*coalesce(IC, 0))

| eval indexscore=if(TP+EFP>0, round(((log(TP+1)*(1+(w*(TP/(TP+EFP)))))-((k*log(EFP+1))/(log(TP+1)+1)))*10, 2), "-")
| fields - EFP
